Restore reserved VectorImpl/SortedVectorImpl ABI slots (lineage-15.1)

Target tree: system/core (LineageOS lineage-15.1).

Why: the Samsung GB-era blobs of GT-I8150 (ancora) - libcamera.so is the
only device-relevant importer - carry undefined references to the FBC
reserved virtual slots that libutils removed again after KitKat:

  _ZN7android10VectorImpl19reservedVectorImpl1..8E          (8x)
  _ZN7android16SortedVectorImpl25reservedSortedVectorImpl1..8E (8x)

Without these, camera.msm7x30.so fails to dlopen its blob chain with
"cannot locate symbol reservedVectorImpl1".  This is the lineage-15.1
rewrite of two cm-11-era patches kept for legacy-blob compatibility by
tlaplayer/CM (Dave Burke 04e5e3b6 + Arne Coucheron 1ff78544) and AriesVE
(frameworks/native commits 04e5e3b6/1ff78544 equivalents).

Notes on the rewrite:
  * The original pair was gated on NEEDS_VECTORIMPL_SYMBOLS (per-device
    board flag through the legacy make build).  Oreo's libutils is a
    soong module with no trivial per-device cflag hook, and the slots are
    pure ABI padding (eight empty virtuals at the end of each class) -
    so they are restored unconditionally.  Verified that the classes'
    remaining virtual declaration order is identical to the blob-era
    header, so appending the slots reproduces the blob-era vtables
    exactly; the blobs import no VectorImpl vtable/typeinfo symbols.
  * File locations moved for Oreo: include/utils -> libutils/include/utils,
    libutils/ -> system/core/libutils/.

Apply on the build box (mandatory for the Oreo port):
    cd system/core && git apply --ignore-whitespace \
        device/samsung/ancora/patches/system-core-15.1-vectorimpl-reserved.patch

Post-build check (Stage 0 gate in BRINGUP.md):
    nm -D out/target/product/ancora/system/lib/libutils.so | grep reservedVectorImpl
    → must list reservedVectorImpl1..8 (and the SortedVectorImpl eight).

--- a/libutils/include/utils/VectorImpl.h
+++ b/libutils/include/utils/VectorImpl.h
@@ -106,4 +106,15 @@
     virtual void            do_move_forward(void* dest, const void* from, size_t num) const = 0;
     virtual void            do_move_backward(void* dest, const void* from, size_t num) const = 0;

+    // take care of FBC... (legacy blob ABI: Samsung libcamera.so imports
+    // these; restored for GT-I8150 (ancora) - see device/samsung/ancora)
+    virtual void            reservedVectorImpl1();
+    virtual void            reservedVectorImpl2();
+    virtual void            reservedVectorImpl3();
+    virtual void            reservedVectorImpl4();
+    virtual void            reservedVectorImpl5();
+    virtual void            reservedVectorImpl6();
+    virtual void            reservedVectorImpl7();
+    virtual void            reservedVectorImpl8();
+
 private:
@@ -157,3 +157,13 @@
     virtual int             do_compare(const void* lhs, const void* rhs) const = 0;

+    // take care of FBC... (legacy blob ABI, see above)
+    virtual void            reservedSortedVectorImpl1();
+    virtual void            reservedSortedVectorImpl2();
+    virtual void            reservedSortedVectorImpl3();
+    virtual void            reservedSortedVectorImpl4();
+    virtual void            reservedSortedVectorImpl5();
+    virtual void            reservedSortedVectorImpl6();
+    virtual void            reservedSortedVectorImpl7();
+    virtual void            reservedSortedVectorImpl8();
+
 private:
--- a/libutils/VectorImpl.cpp
+++ b/libutils/VectorImpl.cpp
@@ -557,3 +557,12 @@
 }

+void VectorImpl::reservedVectorImpl1() { }
+void VectorImpl::reservedVectorImpl2() { }
+void VectorImpl::reservedVectorImpl3() { }
+void VectorImpl::reservedVectorImpl4() { }
+void VectorImpl::reservedVectorImpl5() { }
+void VectorImpl::reservedVectorImpl6() { }
+void VectorImpl::reservedVectorImpl7() { }
+void VectorImpl::reservedVectorImpl8() { }
